      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.37,
      "end_seconds": 171.14,
      "duration_seconds": 15.77,
      "text": "okay: temp 36.8 degrees BMI works out to 19.6. And And pulse 92 SpO2 98 percent on room air weight 54 kilos BP is 102 over 63 height 166 centimetres"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
