      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.41,
      "end_seconds": 223.67,
      "duration_seconds": 11.26,
      "text": "putting it all together I don't have a clear answer today: a dangerous fast heart rhythm is possible and so is supraventricular tachycardia"
