      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.88,
      "end_seconds": 241.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.03,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a dangerous fast heart rhythm, and we'll know more once the the an urgent ECG is back"
